  "description": "Tharwah Silver is a smooth and modern fragrance that blends aromatic lavender with fresh mint and warm woody depth. The scent feels clean, refined, and slightly creamy, offering a balanced mix of freshness and warmth with a masculine edge. The opening introduces a refreshing burst of mint and bergamot, delivering a cool and slightly citrusy freshness. The heart develops into aromatic lavender and clary sage, adding a clean, herbal sophistication with a soft spicy touch. The base settles into vanilla, tonka bean, and cedarwood, leaving a warm, smooth, and slightly creamy woody trail. Tharwah Silver is perfect for those who enjoy fresh aromatic fragrances with a soft vanilla warmth and a clean, modern character.",
